                        %mi A
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
          %p
            One could argue that a more suitable term for cohomology is
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomotopy"} cohomotopy
